    id: 'alphatheta-ddj-flx2',
    name: 'AlphaTheta DDJ-FLX2',
    category: 'DJ Equipment',
    shortDescription: 'AlphaTheta DDJ-FLX2 Why DDJ-FLX2? Works with various DJ applications Supports music streaming services Smartphone / Tablet / PC / Mac compatible Explore tutorials MIX support...',
    description: 'AlphaTheta DDJ-FLX2 Why DDJ-FLX2? Works with various DJ applications Supports music streaming services Smartphone / Tablet / PC / Mac compatible Explore tutorials MIX support functions Lightweight, compact body with user-friendly features Product image Do you think DJing seems difficult? Ever feel like performing as a DJ in front of people sounds tough? Getting into DJing is super easy! All you need is some gear and a love for music. It’s a fun and awesome way to really enjoy music. The DDJ-FLX2 is all you need to kick off your DJing journey and enjoy music your way. Why DDJ-FLX2? Works with various DJ applications The DDJ-FLX2 works with a number of DJ applications, including rekordbox and djay – popular choices among both beginners and professionals. After installing your preferred app on your mobile device, you can connect to the controller and start DJing right away. If you want to challenge yourself to learn more advanced techniques, you can use DJ software, such as Serato DJ Lite, on your PC/Mac. Compatible DJ applications: Compatible DJ applications and music streaming services Supports music streaming services You can DJ with tracks from music streaming services to suit the the music and DJ style you want to play. The DDJ-FLX2 supports Beatport Streaming, Beatsource Streaming, SoundCloud Go+/DJ, and TIDAL. If you use the djay software/app, you can access Apple Music too. *Please note that the available music streaming services may vary depending on your DJ application and geographical location. Compatible music streaming services: Apple Music, Beatport Streaming, Beatsource Streaming, SoundCloud Go+/DJ, TIDAL Compatible DJ applications and music streaming services Easy on your smartphone, professional on your PC/Mac You can DJ with your favorite device, whether that’s a smartphone, tablet, or PC/Mac. You don’t need to buy a new device just for DJing. Set up for your DJ style Explore tutorials Don’t know how to set up or use the DDJ-FLX2? No problem. Extensive tutorials and pop-hint features in DJ your app are available to help you start DJing with confidence. Quick Start Guide Mix support functions It’s easy to replicate the seamless song mixing of professional DJs thanks to the Smart CFX * and Smart Fader * features on the DDJ-FLX2. Smart CFX, used with the Performance Pads, enables you to recreate complex and dynamic effect techniques. Smart Fader automatically optimizes control of the volume, BPM, and bass, so you can perform perfect mixes with by simply sliding the crossfader. *Function names and operations may vary depending on your DJ application. Demonstrations: #01 Playing with Smart CFX #02 Playing with Smart Fader #03 Playing with Hot Cues #04 Playing with Pad FX Lightweight, compact body with user-friendly features The DDJ-FLX2 is our lightest and most compact DJ controller. It runs on USB bus power, so there’s no need for an external power supply when you connect it to a PC/Mac or a mobile device * via USB Type-C. You can start DJing easily by playing music through the built-in speakers of your PC/Mac/mobile device. Or, if you plug speakers into the audio output terminals of the DDJ-FLX2, you can throw a loud party with friends. *Except for some Android devices. Find out more DDJ-FLX2 compatible DJ applications and music streaming services *1 Compatible music streaming services Compatible DJ applications Mac/PC iOS/Android Mac/PC iOS/Android Mac/PC Apple Music ● ● Beatport Streaming ● ● *2 ● ● ● Beatsource Streaming ● ● ● ● SoundCloud Go+/DJ ● ● ● ● ● TIDAL ● ● ● ● ● *1 Music streaming services may not be available in some countries or regions. Find more details here . *2 Beatport Streaming is not supported by rekordbox for Android. Set up for your DJ style 1 / 4 Smartphone and speaker setup Connect your smartphone/tablet to the DDJ-FLX2 via the USB Type-C cable. Play your mix through the speaker(s) connected to the DDJ-FLX2 via an audio cable. What you need ・Smartphone/tablet ・DDJ-FLX2 ・Speaker(s) (compatible with a wired connection) ・USB Type-C cable (included with the DDJ-FLX2) 2 / 4 PC/Mac setup Connect your PC/Mac to the DDJ-FLX2 via the USB Type-C cable and play your mix from the PC/Mac’s built-in speaker. This setup is only available when using rekordbox. What you need ・PC/Mac ・DDJ-FLX2 ・USB Type-C cable (included with the DDJ-FLX2) 3 / 4 Bluetooth connection setup Connect your smartphone/tablet to the DDJ-FLX2 via the USB Type-C cable. Play your mix through the speaker(s) connected to the DDJ-FLX2 via an audio cable. What you need ・Smartphone/Tablet ・DDJ-FLX2 ・USB Type-C cable (included with the DDJ-FLX2) ・USB Type-C power adapter or Mobile battery 4 / 4 Pro-style setup Connect your PC/Mac to the DDJ-FLX2 via the USB Type-C cable. Play your mix loudly through the speaker(s) connected via an audio cable. What you need ・PC/Mac ・DDJ-FLX2 ・Speaker (compatible with wired connection) ・USB Type-C cable (included with DDJ-FLX2) Specifications Compatible software rekordbox for Mac/Windows',
