    shortDescription: 'Behringer Media 40USB Studio Monitors High-Resolution, 150W Bi-Amplified Digital Monitor Speakers with USB Input Product Features Behringer Media 40USB Studio Monitors MEDIA...',
    description: 'Behringer Media 40USB Studio Monitors High-Resolution, 150W Bi-Amplified Digital Monitor Speakers with USB Input Product Features Behringer Media 40USB Studio Monitors MEDIA 40USB 150-Watt digital monitor speakers combine exceptional connectivity via USB and analog input in a bi-amped, two-way speaker configuration, providing the perfect sonic upgrade for any audio or video application. You’re sure to want a pair for every computer workstation in the house – and they make exceptional add-on speakers for flat-screen TVs and self-contained AV media players – as well as the perfect monitor solution for college dorm rooms or anywhere enjoying music is a must. Bi-Amplification – The Path to Absolute Signal Integrity With its 150 ultra-clean Watts of digital output, delivered through separately-powered drivers via a true bi-amping mode with 2 amplifiers per speaker, the Behringer Media 40USB Studio Monitors delivers high-resolution sound that really brings out the best in your music. You will notice that most competitors apply simple passive crossovers, which not only inaccurately separate the frequency spectrum, but most importantly impact the drivers’ performance. Behringer has gone the extra mile, driving each woofer and tweeter with a separate amplifier for absolute signal integrity. Great care was taken to match the system’s amplifiers and crossover points specifically to the woofer and tweeter for optimal efficiency. MEDIA 40USB’s performance provides ultra-linear frequency response – perfect for multimedia production, or just enjoying sound from your streaming media. USB Simplicity and Elegance USB connectivity eliminates the need for special cables and adapters, which makes setup a breeze – plus, MEDIA 40USB powered speakers are magnetically-shielded to work perfectly with your computer monitor – even when placed in close proximity to video monitors of all types. To add a touch of style to MEDIA 40USB’s amazing sonic features, we wrapped them in an elegantly streamlined package with gracious curves that complements even the most-sophisticated décor. Analog at the Ready Flexibility is built into every pair of Behringer Media 40USB Studio Monitors speakers. You also have the freedom to connect either a stereo TRS or RCA device to the rear panel inputs of the MEDIA 40USB – or mix them with your computer’s digital audio. Glowing Control The beautiful amber glow of Behringer Media 40USB Studio Monitors volume control shows your exact output level and provides an easy go-to knob for fast speaker or headphone level adjustments – plus the internal speakers auto-mute when you connect headphones to the convenient, front-mounted jack. Your Computer’s Next Sound System With its room-filling 150-Watt output, high-quality woofers and tweeters plus true bi-amped mode, flexible USB / analog connectivity and elegant styling, MEDIA 40USB digital monitor speakers will bring your music to life! Get your hands on a pair today and take your digital audio library to the next level.',
