    features: ['100W at 4 Ohms through 2×12″ Speakers. Loud.', 'It has a decent clean channel and is quite useful used only as a cabinet or speaker for another signal chain.', 'Black Fenderface looks really neat.'],
    specifications: [{ label: 'Category', value: 'Amplifiers' }],
    price: 40000,
