    id: 'hartke-410xl-bass-guitar-combo',
    name: 'Hartke 410XL Bass Guitar Combo',
    category: 'Guitars & Bass',
    shortDescription: 'Hartke 410XL Bass Guitar Combo 4 x 10″ Aluminum Cone Bass Cabinet In 1984, Hartke revolutionized bass amplification with the first all-aluminum cone driver that produced bass...',
    description: 'Hartke 410XL Bass Guitar Combo 4 x 10″ Aluminum Cone Bass Cabinet In 1984, Hartke revolutionized bass amplification with the first all-aluminum cone driver that produced bass with a wider dynamic range than ever before. This led to the original Hartke XL Series bass cabinets. Now, to commemorate 35 years of the “Hartke Sound,” the new 410XL V2 Bass Cabinet features Hartke’s classic 4×10 all-aluminum speaker design in a more durable, modern-looking cabinet that can handle 400 watts of power. Highlights Classic Soul The 410XL V2 features Hartke’s classic all-aluminum speaker design to the note! Each proprietary XL low frequency driver features a high-quality aluminum cone with a large 1.5″ voice coil on a Kapton® former, impregnated fabric surrounds and a convex dust cover, all mounted in a heavy-duty steel frame. And just like in 1984, a smooth response with a clear, punchy attack forms the foundation of a remarkable tone that’s perfect for any style of playing. Built to Perform While delivering the same great “Hartke Sound” in spades, the 410XL V2 does offer a new look for a new generation of bass players. Its tuned dual-chamber, dual-ported cabinet constructed of solid 3/4″ plywood enclosure is no longer dressed in black carpet, but now features a textured vinyl covering that is much more modern-looking and durable. A black perforated steel grille adds to an already strong, sleek look, while reinforced corners and two inset carry handles scream “road-ready!”',
    images: ['/images/guitars/hartke-410xl-bass-guitar-combo-1.png'],
