    id: 'hartke-hd-150-bass-combo',
    name: 'HARTKE HD 150 BASS COMBO',
    category: 'Guitars & Bass',
    shortDescription: 'HARTKE HD 150 BASS COMBO HD150 15″ Bass Combo The HD150 Bass Combo packs Hartke’s patented HyDrive speaker technology into a sleek combo design capable of greatly enhancing...',
    description: 'HARTKE HD 150 BASS COMBO HD150 15″ Bass Combo The HD150 Bass Combo packs Hartke’s patented HyDrive speaker technology into a sleek combo design capable of greatly enhancing your low-end tone, with enough power to handle any rehearsal room or small venue. The HD150 also maintains Hartke’s commitment to producing high-quality bass amplification with exceptional durability. Highlights The HyDrive Design The HD150 (150-watt, 15-inch driver, 1-inch tweeter) features Hartke’s patented HyDrive speaker technology, a meticulously crafted hybrid (half paper, half aluminum) cone bass speaker. Combining the warmth and roundness of paper with the punch and attack of aluminum, the HyDrive design produces a serious tone ideal for bassists of all genres and styles. Solid… With Style Packed with professional features, the HD150 combo is designed to be easy to use and reliable for players of all levels. The combo offers volume, bass, mid, and treble controls on its top-mounted amp panel, as well as a 7-band graphic EQ for easy tweaking. It features a full effects loop, as well as a 1/8″ stereo auxiliary input for playing along with your favorite tunes via an MP3 player, and a 1⁄4″ headphone output for more intimate practice sessions. The HD150 also features an XLR direct output for routing your signal to a mixer in both live and studio settings. In addition, the HD150 has a built-in limiter to keep the amp running at safe levels. Finally, its rugged enclosure is stylishly finished with a sleek perforated metal grille, side carry handles and casters. With the exceptional sound of HyDrive speakers in a durable, highly portable enclosure, the Hartke HD150 bass combo is able to perform at levels far beyond ordinary bass combos.',
