    shortDescription: 'NUMARK MIXTRACK PLATINUM FX Mixing Starts Here The Mixtrack Platinum FX has all the essentials you need to sound like a professional DJ! At its core, Mixtrack Platinum FX is a...',
    description: 'NUMARK MIXTRACK PLATINUM FX Mixing Starts Here The Mixtrack Platinum FX has all the essentials you need to sound like a professional DJ! At its core, Mixtrack Platinum FX is a 24-bit 4-deck digital DJ controller with a dedicated software effects section, large 6-inch capacitive-touch jog wheels with built in hi-res displays and 16-multifunctional performance pads. Ready to take on any DJ style and perfect for small events, parties and developing your DJ skills, Mixtrack Platinum FX fuses in-demand functionality with all the tools to craft your signature style – your entry-point into a world of unrestricted DJ performance starts here! Mix with Ease—Instantly! Center stage on Mixtrack Platinum FX are two all-new premium paddle triggers for effortless command over Serato’s built-in software effects; there’s even quick access buttons to essential effects including Echo, Reverb, Flanger, Phaser, HPF (High Pass Filter) and LPF (Low Pass Filter) – a sure-fire guarantee that everything you need for creating build-ups, crafting unforgettable transitions and adding your own unique spin to your mix is only a touch away! Command the Mix with Large Jog Wheels Mixtrack Platinum FX’s rugged capacitive-touch jog wheel design has a large 6-inch surface for supreme reliability and total control of your mix. Never miss a beat and keep your mix completely on point thanks to Mixtrack Platinum FX’s bright, high-resolution Jog Wheel displays with all critical song information relayed, including Beats Per Minute (BPM), Platter Position, Time Remaining, Pitch adjustment and key. Spice Up Your Mix Get creative, remix and perform unforgettable mixes with Mixtrack Platinum FX’s 16 multi-function backlit performance pads! With dedicated quick-access pad mode buttons per deck for Hot Cues, Auto Loop, Sample and Fader Cuts (a signature crossfader effect that emulates a 1-4 click flare on the pads), reimagine and reinterpret your favourite tracks, creating something totally unique! Dedicated Auto Loop Mixtrack Platinum FX’s Auto Loop makes it simple to mix and blend between songs, increasing or decreasing the loop segment with the on-board Loop Multiplier buttons to make electrifying build-ups. Four Decks in the Mix With the Mixtrack Platinum FX, you have access to four layered decks to create remixes and mashups on the fly. Simply tap the deck select function to access four playback decks for unrestricted performance capability. Serato DJ Ready We know your set demands the best, that’s why Mixtrack Platinum FX comes pre-mapped with Serato DJ Lite for Mac & PC (software included) and is upgrade-ready to the full version of Serato DJ. For first-time DJs, Serato DJ Lite now comes with demo music and an easy on-boarding tutorial that will walk you through the basics so you can start DJing right away. Built on Serato DJ Pro technology, Serato DJ Lite is designed to be intuitive, reliable & feature rich. Stream Millions of Songs Never run out of music and keep the dance floor shaking! The Mixtrack Platinum FX comes with Serato DJ Lite, giving you access to stream millions of songs via WIFI from TIDAL or SoundCloud. Upgrade to Serato DJ Pro to unlock even more features. Feature Packed As if all of this wasn’t enough, Mixtack Platinum FX features everything you need for immediate DJ performance, right out the box! Fusing plug and play high speed USB connectivity, a dedicated mixer section outfitted with a full 3-band EQ, filter knobs, channel faders and a cross fader, plus an onboard microphone input, RCA outputs and a headphone output, Mixtrack Platinum FX covers all your bases, catering for anything your next DJ set demands! Microphone not included. SoundSwitch Premium Included Simplify your lighting control with a 2-month trial of SoundSwitch premium DJ lighting software included with the Mixtrack Platinum FX. SoundSwitch is a Digital Lighting Workstation that lets users create lighting displays that are performed in time with audio files when played back live in Serato DJ. It allows DJs and lighting designers the ability to sync lighting visuals with live audio seamlessly.',
