    shortDescription: 'Sennheiser G3 Wireless Microphone Professional wireless solutions for large stages and multi-channel applications One system for exacting demands: G3 combines analog system...',
    description: 'Sennheiser G3 Wireless Microphone Professional wireless solutions for large stages and multi-channel applications One system for exacting demands: G3 combines analog system benefits with sophisticated third generation technology. What this gives you: Extreme ease-of-use for up to 32 channels, huge UHF bandwidth, synchronization via software (ew 300 G3 and better) or infrared, and sophisticated antenna technology to truly satisfy all stage conditions. Tried & tested features make the configuration, channel management and operation all child’s play. The three G3 Series ew 100, ew 300 and ew 500 meet every expectation in these respects – by professionals for professionals. Be it vocal, instrument, wireless monitoring or audio for video – Sennheiser’s evolution wireless G3 system offers the perfect and reliable wireless solution for your audio challenge. Available – with certainty Extended 42 MHz bandwidth, a total of 1680 frequencies and 20 fixed frequency banks – for events that demand reams of transmission links, ew G3 provides leeway in abundance. True Diversity technology employs genuine backup channels for flawless reception quality and the soundcheck mode detects improvable on-stage field strengths. Not to forget the pilot tone squelch for interference-free operation. UK operators licences for 1G8 equipment can be obtained by visiting www.pmse.co.uk More possibilities – simply Every event is unique – ew G3 is equipped to deliver it. The series assuredly supports up to 32 parallel radio links – plenty for complex stage shows or large-scale band performances. With its large selection of accessories, antennae and splitters, the system is perfectly suited to practically every stage scenario. Child’s play ew G3’s ingenuous setup functions drastically reduce the time required. For example, the scan function detects free channels, while the infrared synchronization takes care of the receiver/transmitter configuration – fully automatically of course. User-friendliness is enhanced with backlit graphic displays that deliver all crucial data, and by the intuitive user interface. Additional ease-of-use comes in the form of WSM (Wireless Systems Manager): This software enables the laptop-control of 300 and 500 series transmission links, and the recording and analysis of signal strengths. ew 100 G3 The entry-level series sparkles with unstinting equipment levels and proven technology. It delivers high-grade sound for aspiring artists who can do without the cable but not without the quality. Sound the way you want – where you want. evolution Wireless G3 exploits the full diversity of the legendary evolution microphone capsules to be perfectly tailored to every vocal style. A range of dynamic and condenser capsules is available in cardioid and super cardioid versions. Some sets are also available in the 1800 MHz (1G8) version. And if hands-free operation is required – G3 also offers a selection of top-grade headsets. Instrument Anyone with strings can do without the cable. The small, robust G3 series bodypacks afford unlimited freedom of movement on the stage. Designed for guitarists, bowed and wind instruments as well as bass players – after all the frequency range starts at an impressive 25 Hz. Highly practical: The instrument sets feature an integrated tuner. And all those who prefer the typical cable tone will find a selectable emulator that delivers precisely that. Wireless Monitoring A monitor mix belongs in the ear. Directly. Crystal-clear sound, huge transmission power and outstanding reception quality – G3’s professional wireless monitoring systems enable artists to hear what they need, reliably and precisely. Apart from a setup that could not be more simple, these sets are particularly impressive with their extensive level of equipment, robust metal casing and top-class IE 4 in-ear headphones.',
